ンタも戦士になれ、栄光を継ぐんだ」って……","variant_male_record_index":"192691","variant_female_record_index":"192692","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1524512011:0":{"text":"戦士、戦士、また戦士……！お母さんはどうしてそこまで戦士に執着するんですか……？","source_cn":"……战士、战士，又是战士！阿娘到底为什么这么执着于战士？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA0F0EBA0A30039B0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"戦士、戦士、また戦士……！お母さんはどうしてそこまで戦士に執着するんですか……？","female":"戦士、戦士、また戦士……！お母さんはどうしてそこまで戦士に執着するんですか……？","variant_male_record_index":"192693","variant_female_record_index":"192694","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1524512012:0":{"text":"わたしがここまで戦士になりたくないと思うようになったのも、全部お母さんのせいです！","source_cn":"我根本不在意是否成为战士！我不想当战士，全是因为阿娘！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3EBDDEC01E0507F1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"わたしがここまで戦士になりたくないと思うようになったのも、全部お母さんのせいです！","female":"わたしがここまで戦士になりたくないと思うようになったのも、全部お母さんのせいです！","variant_male_record_index":"192695","variant_female_record_index":"192696","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1524512013:0":{"text":"お母さんが戦士であるため、わたしは置き去りにされ……今では何をするにも戦士の基準が要求されて……","source_cn":"为了战士，阿娘选择抛下我……现在又就用战士的标准要求我...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAB37C2966EBC7702","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"お母さんが戦士であるため、わたしは置き去りにされ……今では何をするにも戦士の基準が要求されて……","female":"お母さんが戦士であるため、わたしは置き去りにされ……今では何をするにも戦士の基準が要求されて……","variant_male_record_index":"192697","variant_female_record_index":"192698","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1524512014:1":{"text":"何が「戦士の栄光」……わたしはその言葉が憎い！それが、わたしたち家族を縛ってるんだ！","source_cn":"她做这些，都是为了所谓的“战士的荣耀”……我讨厌它！是...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFE20745250A900A4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"何が「戦士の栄光」……わたしはその言葉が憎い！それが、わたしたち家族を縛ってるんだ！","female":"何が「戦士の栄光」……わたしはその言葉が憎い！それが、わたしたち家族を縛ってるんだ！","variant_male_record_index":"192699","variant_female_record_index":"192700","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1524512015:1":{"text":"「戦士の栄光」か……","source_cn":"嗯……“战士的荣耀”啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5B17A49EB8055C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1524512016:1":{"text":"私自身は戦士ではないけど、祭官として彼らを治療する中で、その考え方には少しばかり触れてきました。私の意見も聞いてもらえますか？","source_cn":"虽然我并非战士，但作为负责治疗他们的巫祭，我对他们的想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96A1CA45A5A40B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1524512017:0":{"text":"私の考えでは、「戦士の栄光」とは縛りではなく、責任のようなものです。","source_cn":"在我看来，“战士的荣耀”并不是什么束缚，而是一种责任。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDEB2CBF25E4A998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1524512018:1":{"text":"責任……？","source_cn":"……责任？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD07268481CECF25B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1524512019:1":{"text":"そうです。戦士である以上、仲間と団結し、部族を守る責任があります。","source_cn":"没错。身为战士，团结一致、